{"asset_key":"ep4/quest_story_14234220","episode":"ep4","category":"quest_story","story_id":"14234220","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:2:1423422001:1":{"text":"역시 음모를 꾸미고 있었군요! 방금 전 천갑수들도 설마...","source_cn":"你们果然在酝酿着什么阴谋！刚刚那些穿甲兽是不是被你们……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA7E0BC44F5E3B354","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1423422002:1":{"text":"천갑수들은 추락 포션을 처음으로 마실 수 있는 영광을 얻었을 뿐이지! 위선은 집어 치워라. 너희도 곧 저들과 같은 처지가 될 테니까!","source_cn":"它们只是光荣地成为了陨识魔药的第一批享用者！不必伪善，...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x757B99AEE464A21D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1423422003:1":{"text":"그렇게 되면 셀로클랜드의 모든 수원이 추락 포션의 정화를 받아 순수로 돌아갈 테니...","source_cn":"届时萨洛克兰的所有水源都会在陨识魔药的涤荡下重归纯洁……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD72130495D89D26E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1423422004:1":{"text":"셀로클랜드 전체가 여왕님과 퀸 성하를 배신한 대가를 치르게 하겠다!","source_cn":"整个萨洛克兰都要为背叛女王和奎茵冕下的行径付出代价！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x69E36269B30C49B2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1423422005:1":{"text":"말이 전혀 안 통해요! 여기서 막아야 할 것 같아요!","source_cn":"跟她们根本讲不通嘛！只能在这里阻止她们了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9CF4598D5A542E95","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:漫漫":{"text":"해미","source":"漫漫","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:狂热的祭司":{"text":"열광적인 제사장","source":"狂热的祭司","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":6,"localized_text_count":5,"speaker_count":2}}